  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Aura</strong> strong telepathy <strong>ML</strong> 15th; <strong>Cost</strong> 112,000 GP<br>\n<strong>Slot</strong> eyes <strong>Weight</strong> —<br>\nThis kind of third eye is placed on the forehead of a creature suffering mind control, geas/quest, or insanity. If worn without being removed for four hours the creature is completely cured of these effects. [Note: If you are using sanity points this third eye restores them at a rate of one per hour worn.]<br>\n<strong>Construction</strong><br>\n56,000 gp; Craft Wondrous Item, bend reality</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/seraph-magic-items#toc25\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
